# Vault ignore rules. Keep credential material out of the history entirely: a file
# that reaches one commit is readable forever, even if the next commit deletes it.
#
# Verify a credentials file is untracked by listing tracked files and filtering the
# list, never by naming the file in a command. Naming it is how it ends up in a log.
*secret*
*.key
*.pem
.env*
credentials*

# Bulk exports stay local.
95-data/exports/

# Editor and OS noise.
.obsidian/workspace*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
